==English==

===Etymology===
*From {{L.}} ''[[prosecutum]]'', past participle of ''[[prosequor]]''.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|prosecut|ing}}

# {{transitive|law}} To [[start]] [[civil]] or [[criminal]] [[proceeding]]s against.
# {{transitive|law}} To [[charge]], [[try]].
# {{transitive}} To [[pursue]] something to the [[end]].

